#: ../../source/docs/common-rtf.rst:5 629d8ab199c442d88c81d35a4ac754da
msgid "Ready-To-Use & Easy-To-Buy vehicles"
msgstr "即买即用及易购飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtf.rst:7 8cf580e4243240c19a555f861ea477d1
msgid ""
"The following is a list of vehicles that run ArduPilot that can be easily "
"purchased over the internet. These vehicles may come pre-configured with "
"everything required to fly, drive or swim right out of the box, or be a "
"complete kit requiring some assembly. Please check with the vendor prior to "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"以下是可通过互联网轻松购买的运行ArduPilot的飞行器列表。这些飞行器可能开箱即具备飞行、驾驶或游泳所需的一切配置，也可能是需要一定组装的完整套件。请在购买前与销售商确认。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtf.rst:13 8dc7a0313ac64fefaa7f909bc98bd138
msgid ""
"We recommend, when possible, to purchase from our `Partners "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ because they directly support "
"ArduPilot and we are more confident that users can upgrade the firmware on "
"the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"我们建议尽可能从我们的 `合作伙伴 <https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ "
"处购买，因为他们直接支持ArduPilot，我们对用户能够升级飞行器固件更有信心。"

